@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://conference#Abstract> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Abstract> .

<http://conference#Committee> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Committee> .

<http://conference#Committee_member> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Committee> .

<http://conference#Conference> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://conference#Conference_applicant> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://conference#Conference_document> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://conference#Conference_fees> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://conference#Conference_part> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://conference#Conference_volume> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://conference#Conference_www> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://conference#Invited_speaker> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Invited_Speaker> .

<http://conference#Organizing_committee> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Organizing_Committee> .

<http://conference#Paper> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Paper> .

<http://conference#Person> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Person> .

<http://conference#Presentation> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#presentation> .

<http://conference#Program_committee> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee> .

<http://conference#Review> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Review> .

<http://conference#Steering_committee> rdfs:subClassOf <http://sigkdd#Organizing_Committee> .

<http://conference#has_a_program_committee> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee> .

<http://conference#has_an_organizing_committee> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Organizing_Committee> .

<http://conference#was_a_program_committee_of> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee> .

<http://conference#was_an_organizing_committee_of> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Organizing_Committee> .

